OL,3,GNEWSADemolishing Bond film building
OL,4,Awould be a 'loss'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA building made famous by a James Bond
OL,7,Ffilm could be demolished to build 300
OL,8,Fhomes and a new company headquarters.
OL,10,FPlanning applications are set to be
OL,11,Fsubmitted for the redevelopment of the
OL,12,Fformer Motorola building - now a base
OL,13,Ffor Vygon UK - in Swindon, Wiltshire,
OL,14,Fwhich appeared in The World Is Not
OL,15,FEnough in 2001 as a Turkish oil
OL,16,Fplatform.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
PN,34902
SC,0002
CT,3,C
