OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F349A1787667980
OL,1,W5j 5Q555pjsjjj js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSADemolishing Bond film building
OL,4,Awould be a 'loss'
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Jake Chandler, who
OL,7,Fpreviously fought for a neighbouring
OL,8,Fhousing development's streets to be
OL,9,Fnamed after the film, said he would be
OL,10,F"sad" to see the "iconic" building go
OL,11,Fand it would be a "loss" to the town.
OL,13,FVygon's general manager Dale Keegan
OL,14,Fsaid it would "safeguard" the company's
OL,15,F"long term future" in Swindon and
OL,16,F"protect existing jobs".
